  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n456 - (76+15²)+(3)/(4)of(76)/(18)div((19)/(72times 24))\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/60420e461fe5b6ceca036245209dca2a21033053c0523fbb85a573b7542ef49a.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 456 - (76+15²)+(3)/(4)of(76)/(18)div((19)/(72times 24))\n\n⇒ 456 – (76 + 225) + (3)/(4) of (76)/(18) ÷ (19)/(72times 24)\n\n⇒ 456 – 301 + (3)/(4)times (76)/(18) ÷ (19)/(72times 24)\n\n⇒ 456 – 301 + (3)/(4)times (76)/(18) × (72times 24)/(19)\n\n⇒ 456 – 301 + 12 × 24\n\n⇒ 456 – 301 + 288 = 155 + 288 = 443\n\n**Therefore, the simplified value is 443.**",
